  "goodToKnow": "Die Sichel is a sickle, a short curved blade for cutting grass or grain; the larger two-handed tool is die Sense (scythe). Its shape gives die Mondsichel (crescent moon). Hammer und Sichel became the symbol of communism, uniting workers and peasants. In medicine, die Sichelzellenanämie is sickle cell anaemia. Plural: die Sicheln."
